  clock: 2  # bba0
  nonce: bba0  # bba0
  message: "Split out of WI-vuzaf in Phase-7 over-fold reconciliation (the audit flagged WI-vuzaf's 255-node finding as over-folding three mechanisms). THIS item = the Rust separator case: node.id name-slot carries 'MyStruct.method' (dot) while node.name carries 'MyStruct::method' (double-colon) — a separator-normalization bug in the Rust analyzer, a DISTINCT fix from the synthetic-linker category-constant name-slots that WI-vuzaf retains. Evidence: frozen substrate.json (tranche-05 F100.A1). Priority P3 (1 node on this substrate; scope grows on Rust-heavy repos); priority by judgment, not independently blind-judged. Sibling/remainder: WI-vuzaf retains the linker category-constant + starlette route method+path name-slots (one shared producer-id-construction fix)."  # bba0
